:::

```{.r .cell-code}
reassignment <- read.csv(file.path(sensitivity_root, "quartile-reassignment.csv"))
changed_groups <- sum(reassignment$n[reassignment$questionnaire_quartile != reassignment$diary_quartile])
```
:::


The two matched analyses retain 135 participants, 755 participant-days and 34,884 half-hours. The timing measures correlate at $r=$ 0.79, with a median diary-minus-questionnaire difference of 6.1 minutes. Nevertheless, 50 participants change quartile, so this sensitivity tests both phase alignment and group classification.


::: {#tbl-dmsfsc-reassignment .cell tbl-cap='Participant counts by questionnaire and diary quartile on the matched sample.'}

