Both MSF~sc(diary)~ PRC contrasts remain in the more advance-weighted evening-type direction. The published raw curve gives 0.306 (95% CI 0.008 to 0.604), just excluding zero, whereas the drift-corrected contrast is 0.236 (-0.021 to 0.494) and includes zero. This distinction remains conditional on the transferred DLMO alignment and PRC baseline.


