The MSF~sc(diary)~ models have slightly lower held-out RMSE and higher predictive R² for new participants. However, the paired intervals include zero for both coordinates, so the small numerical gains do not establish better prediction. Holding out known participants' final days answers a separate question and is reported in the same table.


