All model-structure sensitivity fits converge. Among the MSF~sc(diary)~ phase runs, variance weighting produces the largest change in a registered contrast (0.344 log10 units), followed by larger bases (0.269) and deletion of the most concentrated site (0.242). These summaries quantify changes in fitted contrasts rather than a separate significance test.


